    "name": "APIGen Connectors Tokens API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The APIGen API provides programmatic access to the APIGen AI-powered API generation platform. It allows you to manage projects, design and generate APIs, define endpoints and schemas, configure connectors to external data sources, deploy APIs to various environments, run automated tests, and manage users and API tokens.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: APIGen Support\n Email: support@apigen.com",
